WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:06.221
Ready to sell your cricket gear?
Here's how to get started on Cricket Market USA.

00:06.800 --> 00:11.440
Go to cricketmarketusa.com and create a seller account.
Choose "I'm selling", then enter your name, email, and a password.

00:14.800 --> 00:18.444
Check your inbox for a verification link,
then sign back in.

00:19.800 --> 00:24.978
In your Seller Dashboard, connect Stripe to receive payouts —
and add a ship-from address so buyers know where their order ships from.

00:28.800 --> 00:37.282
Click "New Listing", choose a category, set the condition and price,
and upload a few photos.

00:37.800 --> 00:44.128
Save as a draft to review, then hit Publish —
your listing goes live instantly.
